Why You'll Love This:
Ribbed Luxury from takeoff to touchdown.



Crafted with our supreme ribbed luxury fabric, the RibSupreme™ Tank is your luxurious companion for travel. The elegant boat neckline and sculpting princess panels create a flattering, structured silhouette, while the ribbed texture makes it effortlessly stylish. It has have a soft inner lining made with modal for a friction-free travel experience. The luxe dual-plated fabric gives a stylish appeal yet ensures inner softness &amp;
